{"4729520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Apestin Explorer", "steam_appid": 4729520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/ac46f1992f4fa9d6a14251212782a085.avif?t=1782599320\" width=1494 height=966 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the early 2000s, a web of abuse, corruption, and secrecy stretched across continents. Behind private estates, luxury lifestyles, and influential circles lay crimes hidden from the public eye. You heard the rumors. Everyone did. <i>Corruption. Power. Something inhuman.</i> But the official story never added up, and the people asking the right questions stopped asking.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Now it's your turn.</u></i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Dark Detective Exploration Experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an eerie world filled with tension, mystery, and unsettling realism. Investigate abandoned facilities, underground locations, secret archives, and forgotten crime scenes connected to a disturbing conspiracy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/f75a9e9d47f7a6ea8dfe14969d8afe9b.avif?t=1782599320\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras_big/f75a9e9d47f7a6ea8dfe14969d8afe9b.webp?t=1782599320 width=1560 height=395 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/87858d0ba89b08eee1e59543708d9ffa.poster.avif?t=1782599320\" width=756 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/87858d0ba89b08eee1e59543708d9ffa.webm?t=1782599320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/87858d0ba89b08eee1e59543708d9ffa.mp4?t=1782599320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become an Investigative Detective</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search environments carefully, gather evidence, uncover hidden files, and connect fragments of information to slowly reveal the truth behind a massive criminal network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/5b539bcf0560b63da92b8fcffb27449b.avif?t=1782599320\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras_big/5b539bcf0560b63da92b8fcffb27449b.webp?t=1782599320 width=1560 height=345 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/2a47df5aa3993554582e209d15b4495c.poster.avif?t=1782599320\" width=756 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/2a47df5aa3993554582e209d15b4495c.webm?t=1782599320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/2a47df5aa3993554582e209d15b4495c.mp4?t=1782599320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clue-Based Mystery Investigation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no traditional choice-based story paths. Progress depends entirely on your ability to discover clues, analyze details, and connect the dots between events, people, and locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror Rooted in Reality</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apestin Explorer creates fear through disturbing revelations, oppressive environments, hidden truths, and the terrifying possibility that the true evil exists within humanity itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/534277a4bf2439463c7de6a78abac94b.avif?t=1782599320\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras_big/534277a4bf2439463c7de6a78abac94b.webp?t=1782599320 width=1560 height=367 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/185fcbd8d1b54f0f7c1a23ff2a656459.poster.avif?t=1782599320\" width=756 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/185fcbd8d1b54f0f7c1a23ff2a656459.webm?t=1782599320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/185fcbd8d1b54f0f7c1a23ff2a656459.mp4?t=1782599320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a Massive Hidden Conspiracy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the investigation progresses, seemingly unrelated incidents begin to connect, revealing a horrifying network far larger than anyone imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/9ee31c1a8ebbf0d21655ca848f3c288b.avif?t=1782599320\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras_big/9ee31c1a8ebbf0d21655ca848f3c288b.webp?t=1782599320 width=1560 height=380 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere and Sound Design</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed environments, haunting ambient audio, realistic lighting, and unsettling music create a constant sense of paranoia and dread throughout your investigation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/1e87fe9dc476f0be061ddeec0f43869d.poster.avif?t=1782599320\" width=756 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/1e87fe9dc476f0be061ddeec0f43869d.webm?t=1782599320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/1e87fe9dc476f0be061ddeec0f43869d.mp4?t=1782599320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For decades, they operated in plain sight. Behind luxury estates, private gatherings, and carefully crafted reputations, a hidden network exploited the vulnerable while the powerful looked the other way. As long-buried secrets began to surface, one horrifying truth emerged: the real monsters were not lurking in the dark. They were protected by wealth, influence, and a system designed to keep them untouchable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/9d2bc929460a31a37009a982df52e922.poster.avif?t=1782599320\" width=756 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/9d2bc929460a31a37009a982df52e922.webm?t=1782599320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/9d2bc929460a31a37009a982df52e922.mp4?t=1782599320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Apestin Explorer, you play as a detective determined to uncover the truth behind the massive underground crime network buried beneath layers of secrecy, manipulation, and terror. Explore abandoned locations, collect hidden evidence, and connect scattered clues tied to horrifying events that were never meant to be exposed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/d5154690d45e4dea13580efd46895f86.poster.avif?t=1782599320\" width=756 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/d5154690d45e4dea13580efd46895f86.webm?t=1782599320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/d5154690d45e4dea13580efd46895f86.mp4?t=1782599320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every document, hidden room, and forgotten recording pulls you deeper into a world where power silences justice and fear controls reality. The deeper you investigate, the darker the truth becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/5cff6ad0b0f1968b917f1055ec95fa1d.poster.avif?t=1782599320\" width=756 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/5cff6ad0b0f1968b917f1055ec95fa1