 system designed to keep them untouchable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/9d2bc929460a31a37009a982df52e922.poster.avif?t=1782599320\" width=756 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/9d2bc929460a31a37009a982df52e922.webm?t=1782599320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/9d2bc929460a31a37009a982df52e922.mp4?t=1782599320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Apestin Explorer, you play as a detective determined to uncover the truth behind the massive underground crime network buried beneath layers of secrecy, manipulation, and terror. Explore abandoned locations, collect hidden evidence, and connect scattered clues tied to horrifying events that were never meant to be exposed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/d5154690d45e4dea13580efd46895f86.poster.avif?t=1782599320\" width=756 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/d5154690d45e4dea13580efd46895f86.webm?t=1782599320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/d5154690d45e4dea13580efd46895f86.mp4?t=1782599320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every document, hidden room, and forgotten recording pulls you deeper into a world where power silences justice and fear controls reality. The deeper you investigate, the darker the truth becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/5cff6ad0b0f1968b917f1055ec95fa1d.poster.avif?t=1782599320\" width=756 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/5cff6ad0b0f1968b917f1055ec95fa1d.webm?t=1782599320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/5cff6ad0b0f1968b917f1055ec95fa1d.mp4?t=1782599320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras/4d8b018f1377b20cd1b0dc1c2ded3972.avif?t=1782599320\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/extras_big/4d8b018f1377b20cd1b0dc1c2ded3972.webp?t=1782599320 width=1560 height=430 /></span></p>", "short_description": "You are a detective about to enter the island where the crime of the century happened. Disturbing crimes were hidden behind power and influence. Explore, collect evidence, connect clues, and expose the truth that real monsters are never supernatural, they are people protected by power.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/000cbb28210a5bca97da2ea172a39e92a79f87fa/header.jpg?t=1782599320", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/e2824ae05cf480b3408bd82c3e4766715cd4b135/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782599320", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4729520/e2824ae05cf480b3408b